<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', padding: '60px', background: '#FFFFFF', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei, Arial' }}><Box style={{ height: 76, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4, justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#2563EB', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 1 }}>{ "第 4 站 · 宿主、引擎与界面   /   FILE 26 / 42   /   3/3" }</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>{ "PopupForm.cs · 候选窗：无边框、置顶、永不抢…" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB', marginTop: 6, marginBottom: 12 }} /><Box style={{ height: 450, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}><Box style={{ width: 300, height: 450, background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 8, padding: 14, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline', gap: 12 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2563EB' }}>{ "FILE 26" }</Text></Box><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B' }}>{ "PopupForm.cs" }</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>{ "864 行 · 35 个方法 · 第 3/3 页" }</Text><Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#CBD5E1' }} /><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2563EB' }}>{ "本页 12 个函数在讲什么" }</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>{ "接着上一页：先看 bool / Is 判定函数，再看 void / On 动作…" }</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2563EB' }}>{ "按用途分三组" }</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>{ "条件判定（bool）：0 个" }</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>{ "状态动作（void）：9 个" }</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>{ "文本 / 数值 / 其它：2 个" }</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2563EB' }}>{ "别跳过的一句" }</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>{ "抢一下焦点，用户在 VBE 的输入就断了；字体要去 Light/T…" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 450, border: '1px solid #E5E7EB', borderRadius: 8, padding: 14, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 28, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 4, padding: '0 8px' }}><Text style={{ width: 248, fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A8A' }}>{ "函数 / 成员" }</Text><Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A8A' }}>{ "这一行在讲什么" }</Text><Text style={{ width: 50, fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', textAlign: 'right' }}>{ "行号" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ height: 32, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0 8px' }}><Text style={{ width: 248, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A8A' }}>{ "Truncate" }</Text><Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 16, color: '#1E293B' }}>{ "超过 maxW 就用 ... 省略。pre…" }</Text><Text style={{ width: 50, fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', textAlign: 'right' }}>{ "L662" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ height: 32, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, background: '#F8FAFC', padding: '0 8px' }}><Text style={{ width: 248, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A8A' }}>{ "DrawIcon" }</Text><Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 16, color: '#1E293B' }}>{ "五档图标全部现画（不发位图）：函数=绿箭头…" }</Text><Text style={{ width: 50, fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', textAlign: 'right' }}>{ "L682" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ height: 32, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0 8px' }}><Text style={{ width: 248, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A8A' }}>{ "RowAt" }</Text><Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 16, color: '#1E293B' }}>{ "由鼠标 y 坐标反算点中的是第几条候选" }</Text><Text style={{ width: 50, fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', textAlign: 'right' }}>{ "L738" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ height: 32, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, background: '#F8FAFC', padding: '0 8px' }}><Text style={{ width: 248, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A8A' }}>{ "OnMouseMove" }</Text><Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 16, color: '#1E293B' }}>{ "更新悬停行高亮" }</Text><Text style={{ width: 50, fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', textAlign: 'right' }}>{ "L746" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ height: 32, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0 8px' }}><Text style={{ width: 248, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A8A' }}>{ "OnMouseLeave" }</Text><Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 16, color: '#1E293B' }}>{ "鼠标离开时清掉悬停态" }</Text><Text style={{ width: 50, fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', textAlign: 'right' }}>{ "L774" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ height: 32, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, background: '#F8FAFC', padding: '0 8px' }}><Text style={{ width: 248, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A8A' }}>{ "OnMouseDown" }</Text><Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 16, color: '#1E293B' }}>{ "记录按下，为点击选中做准备" }</Text><Text style={{ width: 50, fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', textAlign: 'right' }}>{ "L783" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ height: 32, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0 8px' }}><Text style={{ width: 248, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A8A' }}>{ "OnMouseUp" }</Text><Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 16, color: '#1E293B' }}>{ "抬起时真正选中并写回（不抢焦点）" }</Text><Text style={{ width: 50, fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', textAlign: 'right' }}>{ "L814" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ height: 32, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, background: '#F8FAFC', padding: '0 8px' }}><Text style={{ width: 248, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A8A' }}>{ "OnMouseWheel" }</Text><Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 16, color: '#1E293B' }}>{ "滚轮翻候选，不把焦点从 VBE 抢走" }</Text><Text style={{ width: 50, fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', textAlign: 'right' }}>{ "L823" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ height: 32, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0 8px' }}><Text style={{ width: 248, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A8A' }}>{ "ShowAt" }</Text><Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 16, color: '#1E293B' }}>{ "先定位、再显示。顺序反了用户会看到窗口在屏…" }</Text><Text style={{ width: 50, fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', textAlign: 'right' }}>{ "L834" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ height: 32, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, background: '#F8FAFC', padding: '0 8px' }}><Text style={{ width: 248, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A8A' }}>{ "Dispose" }</Text><Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 16, color: '#1E293B' }}>{ "释放自绘用的画笔、字体等非托管资源" }</Text><Text style={{ width: 50, fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', textAlign: 'right' }}>{ "L840" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ height: 32, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0 8px' }}><Text style={{ width: 248, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A8A' }}>{ "WndProc" }</Text><Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 16, color: '#1E293B' }}>{ "拦截激活/焦点类消息，实现「永不抢焦点」" }</Text><Text style={{ width: 50, fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', textAlign: 'right' }}>{ "L852" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ height: 32, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, background: '#F8FAFC', padding: '0 8px' }}><Text style={{ width: 248, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#64748B' }}>{ "读法提示" }</Text><Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 16, color: '#64748B' }}>{ "按行号顺序读：先看判定函数，再看动作函数" }</Text><Text style={{ width: 50, fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', textAlign: 'right' }}>{ "—" }</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 8, padding: '0 16px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#2563EB', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>{ "带走：抢一下焦点，用户在 VBE 的输入就断了；字体要去 Light/Thin，字号比 VBE 小一号。" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 30, left: 60, right: 60, height: 20, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>{ "VbeComplete-CS · 逐文件精读 · 面向零基础读者" }</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>{ "P58 / 87" }</Text></Box></Slide>